> Volunteers are vital to Thames Reach in our efforts to end street homelessness and support vulnerable and socially excluded[ people across] London.
As well[ as] helping[ individuals to] take steps forward in their lives, volunteering also offers opportunities to learn, meet new[ people] and experience something different.
Benefacto is a[ social] enterprise helping to get people who work in a professional capacity to volunteer in their local communities. Since[ last] June, they’ve been arranging for professional and corporate volunteers[ to] dedicate[ some] of their time[ to] helping Thames[ Reach clients at i]Re[ach, a weekly] digital skills workshop[ at our] Employment[ Academy in Camberwell].
